guide butler-routes-completionist/orgrimmar-city
title Orgrimmar
levels 1-60
zone Orgrimmar
faction Horde
category Leveling
folder Cities
coords live
version 1
keywords orgrimmar, city, completionist

# Orgrimmar is the Horde capital and a hub the player returns to for fifty
# levels, so this route groups by district and keeps every chain together.
# Out-of-city objectives ride in expedition legs grouped by destination zone,
# each with a deliberate zone-frame switch and a switch back. Every goto and
# complete below is a point from the game data; where the data gives no point
# the note says so instead of inventing one.

step Gates of Orgrimmar — hearth and flight
  note Set the hearth at Innkeeper Gryshka and take the flight from Doras; the whole route returns here.
  accept 936 -- Assisting Arch Druid Runetotem - Innkeeper Gryshka; Arch Druid Hamuul Runetotem waits in Thunder Bluff, late
  note 6385's pre (6384, a Barrens accept) turns in just below — take it first if offered.
  accept 6385 only Orc,Troll -- Doras the Wind Rider Master - Innkeeper Gryshka; Doras the Wind Rider Master by the gate
  turnin 6385 only Orc,Troll -- Doras the Wind Rider Master - back to Doras
  accept 6386 -- Return to the Crossroads - Doras; Zargh waits in the Barrens, late
  note 6386's follow-up (6387, Zargh's Barrens chain) stays out — turn in to Zargh on the Barrens leg and stop there.
  accept 5927 only Druid,Tauren -- Heeding the Call - Innkeeper Gryshka; Turak Runetotem waits in Mulgore, late
  note 5927's follow-up (5922, Mulgore) stays out — turn in to Turak on the Mulgore leg and stop there.

step Valley of Strength — Eitrigg's council
  accept 787 -- The New Horde - Eitrigg; Gornek waits in Durotar
  note 787 turns in to Gornek in Durotar — the Durotar guide owns that leg.
  accept 95283 -- The Missing Kor'kron - Eitrigg; Nazeer Bloodpike waits in the Barrens, late

step Grommash Hold — Thrall's war council
  note The Head of Rend Blackhand (12630) has no placed point in the data: bring Rend's head from the world, so this accept never wedges — check the bags on the way.
  note 4974's pre (4941, a Badlands accept) turns in just below — take it first if offered.
  accept 93739 -- Exploring the Horde - Thrall; four leaders across the Horde
  complete 93739 @32.3,35.75 era -- Nazgrel for Thrall
  complete 93739 @34.34,36.33 era -- Vol'jin for Thrall
  note Cairne waits in Mulgore and Sylvanas in the Undercity — their completes ride on those legs below.
  turnin 93739 -- Exploring the Horde - the leaders' word to Thrall
  accept 4974 -- For The Horde! - Thrall; Warchief Rend Blackhand's head
  complete 4974 -- the Head of Rend Blackhand, from Upper Blackrock Spire with a group, for Thrall
  turnin 4974 -- For The Horde! - the head to Thrall
  accept 6566 -- What the Wind Carries - Thrall; Thrall's tale
  complete 6566 @31.78,37.81 era -- Thrall's tale
  turnin 6566 -- What the Wind Carries - back to Thrall
  accept 6567 -- The Champion of the Horde - Thrall; Rexxar waits in Desolace, late
  note 6567's follow-up (6568, Rexxar's Desolace chain) stays out — turn in to Rexxar on the Desolace leg and stop there.
  note 4002's pre (4001, whose giver has no placed point) never fills — take 4002 on its own.
  accept 4002 -- The Eastern Kingdom - Thrall; Thrall's word
  turnin 4002 -- The Eastern Kingdom - back to Thrall
  note Kharan has no placed point in the data: take the quest now, find the Emperor inside Blackrock Depths with a group, hand in on return.
  accept 4003 -- The Royal Rescue - Thrall; Emperor Dagran Thaurissan, in Blackrock Depths, very late
  complete 4003 -- Emperor Dagran Thaurissan, in Blackrock Depths with a group
  turnin 4003 -- The Royal Rescue - Moira Bronzebeard has no placed point in the data — hand in where she stands
  accept 96376 -- State Secrets - Nazgrel; a Document Box
  note The Document Box (274041) has no source in the data: it comes with the world around the quest, so this accept never wedges — check the bags on the way.
  complete 96376 @32.3,35.75 era -- the Document Box for Nazgrel
  turnin 96376 -- State Secrets - the box to Nazgrel

step Grommash Hold — Thrall's war council, continued
  note 7491's pre (7490) starts from the Head of Onyxia (18422), which drops off Onyxia herself: bring the head from the world, so this accept never wedges — check the bags on the way.
  accept 7491 -- For All To See - Thrall; Overlord Runthak waits below
  note 7784's pre (7783) starts from the Head of Nefarian (19002), which drops off Nefarian himself: bring the head from the world, so this accept never wedges — check the bags on the way.
  accept 7784 -- The Lord of Blackrock - Thrall; High Overlord Saurfang waits below
  note 98024's pre (95350, a Mulgore accept) is OUT — take 98024 on its own.
  accept 98024 -- Journey to the Crossroads - Thrall; Thork waits in the Barrens, late

step Grommash Hold — the Hidden Enemies chain
  note The Lieutenant's Insignia (14544) drops off the Burning Blade in Durotar (expedition below): bring it from the world, so this accept never wedges — check the bags on the way.
  accept 5726 -- Hidden Enemies - Thrall; a Lieutenant's Insignia
  note The insignia drops off the Burning Blade on Thunder Ridge — its complete and turn-in both ride on the Durotar leg below.
  note Thrall's word (5727) and the rest of the chain ride post-Durotar (below), after the insignia turns in.

